Package: rye
Type: Package
Title: Rapid Ancestry Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrew", "Conley", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "aconley@ihrc.com"),
    person("Lavanya", "Rishishwar", role = "aut"),
    person("Shivam", "Sharma", role = "ctb"),
    person("Emily", "Norris", role = "ctb"),
    person("Maria", "Ahmad", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Estimates global genetic ancestry from principal-component data
    using non-negative least squares and a single-thread-optimized Rust core.
    Independent optimization attempts can run in parallel while the numerical
    core uses runtime-dispatched NEON, AVX2, or AVX-512 kernels.
License: GPL (>= 3)
